{"session": 1, "turn_no": 2, "world_time": "Sim drill, round 2", "kind": "gm_narration", "summary": "Narration for m8e2e-1794970143", "actor": "gm", "visibility": "player", "knowledge_type": "fact", "known_to": [], "caused_by": ["evt_0019"], "roll_ids": [], "tags": [], "details": {"text": "You give ground, the indigo blade held high between you and the near hound, jaw set. The construct does not let you go cleanly: as you step out of its reach it lunges, and its projected jaws close on you with a force the sim does not soften. Pain flares bright and hot, and you keep your feet only by the time you reach Wick's side. You are badly hurt, running on very little now.\n\nWick sees the blood and backs a step, putting you between himself and the hound; his pistol comes up, but he does not fire. The near hound is on you again a heartbeat later, closing the gap in a rush, and snaps at you. This time your blade is there, and its teeth close on nothing. Along the right wall the far hound lopes in toward Wick and pulls up short, a little out of reach, its gaze fixed on him. The crates on your left are silent.\n\nIt is your turn. The near hound is within reach of your blade, the far one is circling closer to Wick, and Wick is right behind you."}, "event_id": "evt_0046", "idempotency_key": "batch:m8e2e-1794970143:28"}
